// =============================================================================
// std/internal/runtime/c_object.ax - the root module of an object (or IR) of
// C translation units without a function main: `axiom build lib.c
// --emit=obj`. It has nothing of its own, so that the object holds the
// units' code alone (no start-up, no runtime), to be linked into another
// program. A C program's root is c_start.ax.
// =============================================================================
